The three audiences in "Built for people who need to get it right" each get their icon back, in a green disc above the name:
- a target for brands;
- a handshake for agencies;
- a chess knight for strategy teams.

The icons are the ones the old grey cards already carried (`$audiences`). The disc takes the same green as the titles below it.

Checked locally at 1440 px. All tests pass.
